{"articleNo":"2807","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2807&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 복수전공 이수대상자 선발계획 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.04.04","hit":"11451","attachments":[{"name":"이수 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2807&attachNo=2555"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011학년도 복수전공 이수신청 안내</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">011학년도 복수전공 이수 신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">하오니 희망하는 학생은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">◁ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▷</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">2011. 4. 5(화) ~ 4. 7(목)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 신청 학부 : 전학부(야간과정 소속 학생은 야간과정에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 신청 자격 : 3학기 이상 등록을 필한 재학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 103.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -103.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4.선발 자격 : 3</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">학기 이상 수료하고, 평점평균이 3.00 이상이어야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">☞ 3학기는 2010학년도 2학기를 포함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 103.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -103.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 선발 확정 : 2011. 7. 15(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 이수 정원 : 전공정원(입학정원)의 50%이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">7. 신청 장소 : 주전공 학부장을 경유하여 복수전공 학부사무실에 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">8. 제출 서류 : 복수전공 이수 신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">9. 복수전공 신청자의 과목이수<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 기초도구과목<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">복수전공 학부에서 지정한 MSC(기초필수)과목 모두 이수하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 전공과목&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;• 20</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">05학년도 이전 입학자 : 주</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">전공 45학점 이상 및 복수전공 39학점<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;이상을</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 이수하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;• 2</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">0</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">06학년도 이후 입학자 : 주전공 65학점 이상 및 복수전공<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 39학점 이상을</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 이수하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;• 자연과학부 및 경영학과는 입학년도에 관계없이 주전공 45학점 이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;및 복수전공 39학점 이상을 이수하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;• 주전공 과목이 복수전공 과목과 동일한(학부 지정) 경우 9학점까지<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;복수전공 학점&nbsp; 으로 인정함.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다만, 교직과정 이수자는 중복 인정하지 않음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">10. 기타 : 복수전공은 공학교육인정과정을 적용하지 아니함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2011.&nbsp; 4.<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
